Feature: Supplier Development Manager Qualification and Development
  As David Thompson, Supplier Development Manager
  I want to efficiently qualify and develop suppliers across Asia Pacific region
  So that I can build robust supplier capabilities while reducing qualification timeline and maintaining quality standards

  Background:
    Given I am logged in as David Thompson, Supplier Development Manager
    And I have access to the supplier qualification and development system
    And I manage 6 development specialists across Asia Pacific region
    And I coordinate supplier development across multiple countries and cultures

  @supplier-qualification @standardization
  Scenario: Standardized supplier qualification process across Asia Pacific
    Given I need to qualify a new electronics supplier in Vietnam
    And I want to ensure consistent qualification standards across all markets
    When I initiate a new supplier qualification process
    Then I should have access to standardized assessment templates by category
    And the templates should be localized for Vietnamese regulatory requirements
    And I should be able to assign qualification tasks to local team members
    And I should have clear milestone checkpoints and approval workflows
    And I should be able to track qualification progress in real-time

  @mobile-assessment @field-operations
  Scenario: Conduct on-site supplier assessment using mobile tools
    Given I am conducting an on-site assessment at a potential supplier in Thailand
    And I need to document findings and capture evidence during the visit
    When I use the mobile assessment application
    Then I should be able to complete assessment forms offline
    And I should be able to capture photos and documents with GPS location data
    And I should be able to record audio notes and observations
    And I should be able to sync data when connectivity is restored
    And I should be able to generate preliminary assessment report on-site

  @virtual-assessment @remote-capabilities
  Scenario: Conduct virtual supplier assessment when travel is restricted
    Given travel restrictions prevent on-site visits to a supplier in India
    And I need to complete qualification assessment remotely
    When I initiate a virtual assessment process
    Then I should be able to schedule virtual facility tours with supplier
    And I should have structured virtual assessment protocols
    And I should be able to request specific documentation and evidence remotely
    And I should be able to coordinate with local third-party auditors when needed
    And I should be able to complete qualification with appropriate confidence level

  @supplier-development @capability-building
  Scenario: Create and monitor supplier capability development roadmap
    Given a qualified supplier needs capability improvements before full integration
    And the supplier shows potential but has specific development needs
    When I create a supplier development roadmap
    Then I should be able to identify specific capability gaps and improvement areas
    And I should create milestone-based development plan with timelines
    And I should be able to assign development support resources
    And I should track progress against development milestones
    And I should measure ROI on development investments

  @multi-language @cultural-adaptation
  Scenario: Support assessment and development in multiple languages and cultures
    Given I work with suppliers across diverse Asian markets
    And each market has different languages and cultural business practices
    When I conduct supplier assessments and development activities
    Then the system should support multiple languages (Chinese, Vietnamese, Hindi, etc.)
    And assessment criteria should be adapted for local business practices
    And I should have access to cultural guidance for each market
    And I should be able to work with local translators and cultural liaisons
    And I should maintain consistency while respecting cultural differences

  @compliance-tracking @regulatory-management
  Scenario: Ensure supplier compliance with regional and international standards
    Given suppliers must comply with multiple regulatory frameworks
    And compliance requirements vary by product category and destination market
    When I manage supplier compliance documentation
    Then I should have access to current regulatory requirements by market
    And I should track supplier certifications and compliance status
    And I should receive alerts for expiring certifications or regulatory changes
    And I should be able to coordinate with legal and compliance teams
    And I should maintain audit trails for all compliance activities

  @team-coordination @cross-timezone-management
  Scenario: Coordinate team activities across multiple time zones
    Given my team members are distributed across Asia Pacific region
    And we need to coordinate on complex qualification projects
    When I manage team coordination and communication
    Then I should be able to schedule meetings across multiple time zones
    And I should have shared project visibility and status updates
    And I should be able to delegate tasks with clear accountability
    And I should receive consolidated progress reports from all team members
    And I should be able to provide consistent support and guidance to team

  @quality-assurance @performance-monitoring
  Scenario: Monitor and improve new supplier performance post-qualification
    Given newly qualified suppliers need ongoing monitoring and support
    When I track new supplier performance and integration success
    Then I should monitor supplier performance against qualification criteria
    And I should track key metrics like quality, delivery, and cost performance
    And I should identify early warning signs of performance issues
    And I should provide targeted support and development interventions
    And I should measure supplier success rate and qualification process effectiveness

  @rapid-qualification @emergency-sourcing
  Scenario: Accelerate qualification process for urgent business needs
    Given an emergency sourcing need requires rapid supplier qualification
    And normal 90-day process is too slow for business requirements
    When I initiate accelerated qualification process
    Then I should have streamlined assessment workflows for emergency situations
    And I should be able to prioritize critical qualification criteria
    And I should coordinate with headquarters for expedited approvals
    And I should maintain appropriate risk assessment and mitigation
    And I should document any compromises or additional monitoring requirements

  @knowledge-management @best-practices
  Scenario: Capture and share supplier development best practices across regions
    Given successful supplier development approaches should be shared across markets
    When I document and share successful development strategies
    Then I should be able to capture detailed case studies and lessons learned
    And I should contribute to global best practices database
    And I should access proven development approaches from other regions
    And I should participate in knowledge sharing sessions with other development managers
    And I should continuously improve qualification and development methodologies

  @relationship-building @long-term-partnerships
  Scenario: Build long-term strategic partnerships with key suppliers
    Given some suppliers have potential for strategic partnership beyond basic qualification
    When I identify and develop strategic supplier relationships
    Then I should assess suppliers for strategic partnership potential
    And I should create joint development roadmaps with strategic suppliers
    And I should facilitate connections between suppliers and MegaMart business units
    And I should track and measure partnership value and benefits
    And I should maintain strong personal relationships with key supplier contacts

  @performance-metrics @continuous-improvement
  Scenario: Track and improve supplier development process effectiveness
    Given I need to continuously improve qualification and development processes
    When I analyze supplier development performance and outcomes
    Then I should track key process metrics like timeline, success rate, and cost
    And I should analyze root causes of qualification failures or delays
    And I should identify opportunities for process optimization and automation
    And I should measure team productivity and development effectiveness
    And I should implement continuous improvement initiatives based on data insights
